<title>USA: Starcraft completes National Mobility purchase.</title>
<headline>Starcraft completes National Mobility purchase.</headline>
<dateline>GOSHEN, Ind. 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Starcraft Corp said Friday it completed its acquisition of  National Mobility Corp of Elkhart, Indiana, for an undisclosed price.</p>
<p>National Mobility makes conversion vehicles for the physically challenged, posting annual sales of more than $5 million. Starcraft provides second-stage van, truck and sport utility conversions.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
